# Phase-0 Capacitor spike: CocoaPods, Xcode and the synced web build are all regenerated
# by `pnpm build && npx cap sync ios`. `dist/` and `node_modules/` are already covered above.
spikes/**/ios/App/Pods/
spikes/**/ios/App/App/public/
spikes/**/ios/App/Podfile.lock
spikes/**/ios/DerivedData/
spikes/**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
spikes/**/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/

